index ea1a1a0..11be053 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,22 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- **Breaking:** `v1.FilesService.Add` now takes a file name and an
+  `io.Reader` and builds the `multipart/form-data` request body itself,
+  mirroring `v1.CallLogsService.AddRecording`. Previously callers had to
+  construct the multipart body and pass it together with its content type.
+  Callers that need a custom request body can keep using `client.Raw.Do`.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- File uploads through `v1.FilesService.Add` are now retried on 429 and 5xx
+  responses when a retry policy is enabled. The upload body is built and
+  buffered by the SDK, which makes the request replayable; the previous
+  caller-supplied streamed body was not replayable, so the retry transport
+  skipped it and uploads failed on the first rate-limit response.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
